  "handoff": {
    "summary": "Unconditional replay now dispatches the exact prime-ideal and ordinary-ideal schemas through their authenticating decoders and rejects every other schema. The public degree-six upgrade path replays after class_number(), while direct cubic Minkowski discovery rebuilds a capped independent prime stream, matches it against the retained exact factor base, verifies every quotient witness, and emits the existing authenticated proof-progress format for detached replay. Public proof=False and proof=True cubic groups, detached payload mutations, unknown schemas, and a hostile over-cap live bound are covered.",
